{"unit_id":"RaulLazaro__dsh-pwa-plugin#card-zh","repo":"RaulLazaro/dsh-pwa-plugin","commit":"c170a543e8555b0e3d94730348d8a7e889e7a3bf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pwa-plugin（DSH 网页插件）：为 DSH Web 增加渐进式网页应用能力。它向 WebServer 注册 Service Worker、Web App manifest 和图标路由，并将 Service Worker 注册脚本注入页面。主要功能包括预缓存静态资源、离线时回退已缓存页面、对 HTML 使用网络优先策略、对静态文件使用缓存优先策略，以及检测更新后激活新版本。适合希望将 DSH 网页端安装为应用并在短暂断网时访问已缓存界面的用户。需要通过 HTTPS 提供页面（localhost 例外），不需要额外密钥或服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.js:23-135","src/sw.js:80-175"]}
{"unit_id":"RaulLazaro__dsh-pwa-plugin#card-en","repo":"RaulLazaro/dsh-pwa-plugin","commit":"c170a543e8555b0e3d94730348d8a7e889e7a3bf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pwa-plugin adds installable PWA support to DSH Web with a manifest, icons, and versioned service worker. Static assets are pre-cached; HTML gets a network-first offline fallback. API and WebSocket routes bypass caching. Needs HTTPS (localhost exempt); no keys or external services are needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.js:23-135","src/sw.js:80-175"]}
