{"unit_id":"RaulLazaro__dsh-pwa-plugin#feature-1","repo":"RaulLazaro/dsh-pwa-plugin","commit":"c170a543e8555b0e3d94730348d8a7e889e7a3bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pwa-plugin 的功能「安装为网页应用」：提供包含独立显示模式、启动地址和多尺寸图标的 Web App manifest。浏览器访问 DSH Web 后可按平台提供的安装方式将其加入设备。","source":"generated","evidence":["public/manifest.webmanifest:1-45","src/host/index.js:49-67"]}
{"unit_id":"RaulLazaro__dsh-pwa-plugin#feature-2","repo":"RaulLazaro/dsh-pwa-plugin","commit":"c170a543e8555b0e3d94730348d8a7e889e7a3bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pwa-plugin 的功能「离线静态资源」：Service Worker 安装时逐项预缓存入口页面、manifest 和图标；之后对静态资源优先读取缓存，网络不可用时返回离线响应。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/sw.js:8-17","src/sw.js:80-99","src/sw.js:152-174"]}
{"unit_id":"RaulLazaro__dsh-pwa-plugin#feature-3","repo":"RaulLazaro/dsh-pwa-plugin","commit":"c170a543e8555b0e3d94730348d8a7e889e7a3bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pwa-plugin 的功能「页面离线回退」：导航 HTML 请求先访问网络并缓存可存储的成功响应；请求失败时返回缓存页面，若无缓存则显示离线提示页。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/sw.js:128-149"]}
{"unit_id":"RaulLazaro__dsh-pwa-plugin#feature-4","repo":"RaulLazaro/dsh-pwa-plugin","commit":"c170a543e8555b0e3d94730348d8a7e889e7a3bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pwa-plugin 的功能「自动更新」：页面注入的注册脚本每小时检查 Service Worker 更新；新 worker 激活后通知其跳过等待，并在已有控制器变更时刷新页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.js:101-135","src/sw.js:177-185"]}
{"unit_id":"RaulLazaro__dsh-pwa-plugin#feature-5","repo":"RaulLazaro/dsh-pwa-plugin","commit":"c170a543e8555b0e3d94730348d8a7e889e7a3bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pwa-plugin 的功能「动态路由绕过缓存」：请求 DSH API、OAuth、插件、WebSocket 等动态路径时 Service Worker 不接管，让请求直接到达网络服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/sw.js:48-69","src/sw.js:114-126"]}
